  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）\n9：00 A.M. 天氣/陰\n近衛局大樓天台攻防戰14小時之前\n切爾諾伯格分城“14區”廢墟上空300米處，“壞傢伙”號\n任務目標：與羅德島救援小隊合流，營救偵察小組\n人員配置：\n“壞傢伙”號及其飛行員；羅德島精英幹員-煌，及其小隊成員\n共一十四人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們已經到了，阿米婭她們就在這個位置附近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把小隊放在城外，真的好嗎？我們現在只有兩個人，你下去你只有一個人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，讓他們阻截整合運動的追兵，順便清理下場地，比讓他們在這打仗要有意義得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行。地形不太好，我只能送你到這兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......至少讓我給你放條掛索下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，你什麼時候見我用過掛索？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又要亂來？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？怎麼了？亂來啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "每次和你出任務......你幹的那些事，我光是坐在駕駛座看著都覺得心驚肉跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然不知不覺中也快習慣了，可這也改變不了你次次亂來的事實啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這說明我和我的小隊，和你是有默契的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪敢和你有什麼默契！上回你們把人家的聚落拆了，蓄水池填了，還順帶著炸掉了礦場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你腦袋裡裝著的那些胡思亂想，請通通留在地面上，別帶上我的寶貝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行行行，知道了知道了，“壞傢伙”號，哈？取名時候能不能用點心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你給我下去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敵人估計發現我們了。煌，就送你到這了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在廢城出口等你們。動作快點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，有聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我聽得到！聲音別那麼大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，羅德島頻道的幹員，你好！我是近衛局的，已經在廢城出口處和你們的小隊會合了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "近衛局不是撤離了嗎？現在又是演什麼戲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和另外那個姓陳的可不一樣！相信我，我是來幫你們的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請問貴姓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "免貴，叫代號吧，詩懷雅長官好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不就是姓？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "煌，你來處理下，我不知道怎麼對付官員......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......煌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "我也不會啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回來！別跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "你剛才不是叫我下去嗎？交給你了！相信你！（飛吻）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飛行員",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "飛吻個鬼啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "呼，呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "......她還好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯，已經沒有大礙，只是體溫還有點低。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "從來......就都很低。我沒事了，讓我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "霜葉......別急。你現在的體溫，和平常比還是低了一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "博士，請幫我拿一下繃帶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
          "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
          "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "說了，我很好。隕星的傷才更重。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
          "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
          "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
          "text": "不要緊。怎麼說我也是個薩卡茲人，我還是更擔心你一點。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "潔西卡，雪怪小隊的動向呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
          "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
          "text": "正，正在向我們的位置靠近！還有五百米左右！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "排障作業還沒完成嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "還要至少十五分鐘！這裡倒塌的建築，結構比較複雜，我們不敢直接進行爆破作業。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......隕星，做好戰鬥準備。我們要再維持一會兒防線。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
          "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
          "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
          "text": "明白。你們帶弩彈儲備了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "有的，讓後勤幹員給你......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阿米婭在不在？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
          "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......呃。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "是不是有誰的通訊頻道是一直開著的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這可是精英幹員專用頻道，我是能從我這邊直接打開的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
          "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
          "text": "這個聲音是......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
          "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "完了。居然派了她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "潔西卡",
          "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
          "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
          "text": "請問......是誰？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是啊，這是哪個幹員，怎麼這麼激情？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她真能改善現在的局勢嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
          "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
          "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "一個叫煌的，能把身邊所有東西全拆掉，還讓所有人都流一身汗的幹員。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "沒錯，是我！最後一個評價不太對啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "別......別插科打諢了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "煌，你在哪，我們需要你的支援。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "在你們頭上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "還有兩百米左右。就要到了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "射程不夠，沒法攻擊那台機器！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "能在空中移動的機器......這也是他們的設備？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "確保他們沒法下降。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "在羅德島的援兵到達前，消滅掉這支羅德島小隊。不能讓他們合流。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "等下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1#9",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "———往後站！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "隕星",
          "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
          "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
          "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
          "text": "她又跳下來了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜葉",
          "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
          "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
          "text": "她又跳下來了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "阿米婭，如果你想，我可以帶你一起跳一次！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "如果可以的話，我不要。你的小隊呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "留在城外了，一會兒就由他們來接應。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "風聲很大，把通訊器關了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "各位......我們支援一下煌吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，一會兒無論她說什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......都點頭就好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "掉下來的這是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小隊成員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_037",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "別因為只有一個人就放鬆警惕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "我感受到熱量。她一直在用類似加溫的法術。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "整合運動的各位，你們好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "我不想和感染者為敵。但聽說各位傷害了我的羅德島同僚......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "而且還在追擊我的隊友。現在我要打斷各位一下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "speakerToken": "char_1505_frstar_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1505_frstar",
          "portraitKey": "char_1505_frstar",
          "text": "......多嘴多舌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "嗨，你好，用冰的小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "我想試試用我的溫度和你的溫度打一次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
